1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,590
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:04,510
We've all seen this employee:

3
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:06,680
carrying the whole department on his shoulders…

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,190
and when he takes a vacation…

5
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,520
everything falls apart.

6
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:11,340
That's not excellence…

7
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,630
that's individual effort.

8
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:14,810
The EFQM Model says:

9
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,600
excellence is a system…

10
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,900
three gears turning together:

11
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,930
First:

12
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:20,700
Direction,

13
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,760
Direction:

14
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,100
why do we exist?

15
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,590
and where are we going?

16
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,630
Second:

17
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:27,620
Execution:

18
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,200
how will we get there?

19
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,920
through people, processes and stakeholders.

20
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:32,510
Third:

21
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:34,610
Results:

22
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,060
what did we actually achieve?

23
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,740
in measurable numbers.

24
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,950
Imagine a citizen service centre:

25
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:41,005
its goal: finish a

26
00:00:41,005 --> 00:00:42,060
transaction in 15 minutes…

27
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,590
it automates and trains…

28
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,410
and measures waiting time every month.

29
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:46,920
One gear stops…

30
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,890
the whole machine stops.

31
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,320
Remember it this way:

32
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,990
Excellence is a system… not individual effort.

33
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:55,070
And you? Which gear needs oil?

34
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:56,950
Tell me in the comments

35
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,430
See you tomorrow…

36
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,010
on Masaa Al-Tamayoz
